    "updated_at": "2025-08-29T11:48:50Z",
    "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9900 suggests just making `autoplay` respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. I'm not sure how web-compatible that would be. Also, is it the behaviour you always want, even if `prefers-reduced-motion`?\n\nAnother option is to go with https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9900 but have `autoplay=\"despite-prefers-reduced-motion\"` or whatever.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
