    "updated_at": "2025-08-29T14:06:24Z",
    "body": "> The fact that these effects (currently) play despite `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` still baffles me.\n\nSome discussion here: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10267. View transitions use CSS animations, and CSS animations aren't auto-prevented by prefers-reduced-motion.\n\n\n\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
