    "created_at": "2025-08-30T12:05:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-30T12:49:07Z",
    "body": "Would it make sense to generalize it to other media queries / CSS conditionals as well?\nThis is a common theme in other elements like `link` and `source` (using `when` for this example because `media` feels weird in a `media` element)\nSomething like `autoplay-when=\"media(prefers-reduce-motion: no-preference) and (orientation: landscape)\"` or some such\n\n* this can work with either decision about changing the default\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
